       Displays permissions that have been delegated on the specified filesys‐
       tem or volume.  See the other forms of zzffss aallllooww for more information.

       Delegations are supported under Linux with the exception of mmoouunntt,
       uunnmmoouunntt, mmoouunnttppooiinntt, ccaannmmoouunntt, rreennaammee, and sshhaarree.  These permissions
       cannot be delegated because the Linux mount(8) command restricts modi‐
       fications of the global namespace to the root user.

